lf-contract 0.1
# lf-factorial loops (in lf-factorial-from): generator v0 has no loop
# invariants, so it reports the word unsupported. Its correctness is proved
# by induction directly on the IR semantics instead (factorial_correct in
# tests/reference/program-ir.lean).
id lf-factorial/0
word lf-factorial
ir tests/program/ir/examples.ir
stack ( n -- factorial true | false )
inputs n
statement For an integer n in the cell range: if n is negative or n! is above the largest cell the word returns false; otherwise n! and true.
case n < 0
  out false
case n >= 0
  out f true
  ensure f >= 1
expect unsupported
